<rml><head><title>Advanced camera track tools</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml"/><link type="text/rcss" href="theatre.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="camera-tools.rcss"/></head><body template="prime-dialog"><div id="replay_camera_tools_panel" class="prime_dialog"><h2>CAMERA TRACK TOOLS</h2><p id="replay_camera_tools_replay"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_review"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_focus"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_selection"/><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_save" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-save">SAVE CAMERA</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_undo" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-undo">UNDO</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_redo" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-redo">REDO</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_discard" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-discard">DISCARD UNSAVED DOCUMENT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_previous" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-previous">PREVIOUS KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_next" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-next">NEXT KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_nearest" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-nearest">FOCUS NEAREST</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_preview" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-preview">PREVIEW FOCUSED KEY</button></div><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_toggle" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-toggle-selection">TOGGLE FOCUSED SELECTION</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_range" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-range-selection">SELECT ANCHOR RANGE</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_all" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-select-all">SELECT ALL KEYS</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_clear" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-clear-selection">CLEAR SELECTION</button></div><label for="replay_camera_tools_destination">DESTINATION FRAME</label><input id="replay_camera_tools_destination" type="text" maxlength="10"/><p>Group move and paste place the earliest selected or copied key at the destination and preserve the spacing between keys. Existing destination keys are preserved; collisions are refused.</p><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_move" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-move">MOVE SELECTED GROUP...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_copy" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-copy">COPY SELECTED</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_paste" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-paste">PASTE COPIED GROUP...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_duplicate" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-duplicate">DUPLICATE PRECEDING AT PLAYHEAD...</button></div><p>Snap one selected key to the reviewed nearest marker at the playhead.</p><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_event" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-event">SNAP TO NEAREST EVENT...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_kill" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-kill">SNAP TO NEAREST KILL...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_bookmark" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-bookmark">SNAP TO NEAREST BOOKMARK...</button></div><div class="theatre_actions"><p>INDEPENDENT ORIENTATION / LENS CURVES (SELECTED KEYS)</p><div class="camera_channel_controls"><button id="replay_camera_tools_orientation_curve" class="play_action" title="Cycle Inherit, Linear, Smooth, Hold" data-action="replay:camera-tools-orientation-curve">ORIENTATION: INHERIT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_orientation_ease" class="play_action" title="Independent orientation ease: Inherit, None, In, Out, In Out" data-action="replay:camera-tools-orientation-ease">ORIENTATION EASE: INHERIT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_fov_curve" class="play_action" title="Cycle Inherit, Linear, Smooth, Bezier, Hold" data-action="replay:camera-tools-fov-curve">FOV: INHERIT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_fov_ease" class="play_action" title="Independent FOV ease: Inherit, None, In, Out, In Out" data-action="replay:camera-tools-fov-ease">FOV EASE: INHERIT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_roll_curve" class="play_action" title="Cycle Inherit, Linear, Smooth, Bezier, Hold" data-action="replay:camera-tools-roll-curve">ROLL: INHERIT</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_roll_ease" class="play_action" title="Independent roll ease: Inherit, None, In, Out, In Out" data-action="replay:camera-tools-roll-ease">ROLL EASE: INHERIT</button></div><button id="replay_camera_tools_interpolation" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-interpolation">CYCLE SELECTED INTERPOLATION...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_ease" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-ease">CYCLE SELECTED EASING...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_look_at" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-look-at">CYCLE SELECTED LOOK-AT PLAYER...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_remove" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-remove-selected">REMOVE SELECTED KEYS...</button></div><button id="replay_camera_tools_timeline" class="play_action" data-action="replay:timeline-open">GRAPHICAL TIMELINE</button><h3>TRANSFORM SELECTED KEYS</h3><p>Rotate around the world origin, then translate. Rotation values and lens offsets are degrees. The whole group keeps its spacing; destination collisions are refused.</p><label for="replay_camera_transform_x">TRANSLATE X</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_x" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_y">TRANSLATE Y</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_y" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_z">TRANSLATE Z</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_z" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_yaw">ROTATE YAW</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_yaw" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_pitch">ROTATE PITCH</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_pitch" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_roll">ROTATE ROLL</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_roll" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_frame">FRAME OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_frame" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_fov">FOV OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_fov" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_lens_roll">CAMERA ROLL OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_lens_roll" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><button id="replay_camera_tools_transform" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-transform">REVIEW SELECTED TRANSFORM...</button><h3>BEZIER HANDLES</h3><p>Position handles are offsets from each selected key. Use auto for one-third segment handles. Scalar handles are FOV in/out and roll in/out offsets, in degrees.</p><label for="replay_camera_handles_in">INCOMING X, Y, Z</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_in" type="text" maxlength="128" value="auto"/><label for="replay_camera_handles_out">OUTGOING X, Y, Z</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_out" type="text" maxlength="128" value="auto"/><label for="replay_camera_handles_scalar">FOV IN, FOV OUT, ROLL IN, ROLL OUT</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_scalar" type="text" maxlength="128" value="0, 0, 0, 0"/><button id="replay_camera_tools_handles" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-handles">REVIEW SELECTED BEZIER HANDLES...</button><h3>SAMPLED CAMERA CURVES</h3><p>Drag yellow authored keys vertically to change that channel. Blue incoming and gold outgoing handles edit Bezier tangents. Dragging previews an exact change; release commits once in memory. Save publishes the sidecar. The graphical timeline edits key times.</p><div id="replay_camera_curve_surface" tabindex="0"><p>64 samples from the saved camera track, including its interpolation, easing and constant-speed setting. Each channel uses its own vertical bounds. Use the graphical timeline to select and retime keys.</p><p id="replay_camera_curve_bounds_0"/><div class="camera_curve" id="replay_camera_curve_lane_0" tabindex="0"><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_0" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_1" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_2" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_3" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_4" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_5" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_6" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_7" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_8" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_9" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_10" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_11" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_12" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_13" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_14" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_15" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_16" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_17" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_18" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_19" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_20" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_21" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_22" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_23" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_24" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_25" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_26" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_27" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_28" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_29" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_30" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_31" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_32" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_33" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_34" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_35" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_36" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_37" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_38" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_39" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_40" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_41" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_42" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_43" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_44" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_45" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_46" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_47" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_48" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_49" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_50" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_51" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_52" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_53" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_54" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_55" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_56" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_57" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_58" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_59" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_60" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_61" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_62" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_63" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_0" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_1" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_2" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_3" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_4" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_5" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_6" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_7" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_8" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><button id="replay_camera_curve_key_0_9" class="curve_key" data-action="replay:camera-tools-curve-key"/><